    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17711" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτο-ετής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in</i> or <i>of the same year,</i> of trees, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοετεῖς αὐαίνονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					3.7.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔριφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					3.9.3
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοετές</span>”
				<i>within the year,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					3.322
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				36.37
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεννᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					562b12
				</span></i>
			; <i>at one year old,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀχεύεσθαι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				545a24
			</span></i>.</div>
